description:
The current parser.Response is a bare enum (Sat/Unsat/Unknown/Error/Eval/GetInfo/Model) that maps each response to a raw String without extracting structured data. Model responses are unparsed S-expressions. Error responses carry no structured diagnostics.

Define a proper response type hierarchy:
- Response::Sat, Response::Unsat, Response::Unknown (no change)
- Response::Error { message: String, code: Option<String> }
- Response::Eval { value: SExpr }
- Response::GetInfo { keyword: String, value: SExpr }
- Response::GetModel { bindings: Vec<ModelBinding> } (parsed)
- Response::GetUnsatCore { vars: Vec<String> }

Build on the tokenizer (I1a) to parse solver output into this hierarchy.
